message: "If you use this software, please cite the paper below."
title: "CHLOE"
abstract: "CHLOE (Computer-Human Language Oriented Experiment) is a persistent epistemic architecture for inspectable AI: a symbolic epistemic core (beliefs with provenance, scope, per-domain trust and confidence) with replaceable language-model interfaces for linguistic input and output, and an offline consolidation (\"sleep\") cycle."
